<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka T-bills continue to ease in auction.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka T-bills continue to ease in auction.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average yield rate of three, six and 12-month Sri Lankan treasury bills fell sharply at Wednesday's auction which was heavily over-subscribed, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>		  bids received   bids accepted   avg yield</p>
<p>    3 months     3,814	     1,213	  17.72 (18.07)</p>
<p>    6 months	 745		 267	  17.66 (17.87)</p>
<p>    12 months    5,111	     2,356	  17.63 (17.86)</p>
<p>NOTE - Bids in million rupees, yields in percent (previous week's yields in brackets).</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
